www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_6OWFKA2H0&t=21)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/62U6lCUmcU0)[[3]](https://omiwellbeauty.com/blogs/hair/what-are-copper-peptides-and-how-do-they-help-with-hair-growth)[[4]](https://www.perfectb.com/copper-peptide-for-hair-loss-ghk-cu/)[[5]](https://www.mdhair.co/article/the-truth-behind-copper-peptides-for-hair-care)\n- **Scalp health:** They lower scalp inflammation, fight oxidative stress, and boost collagen and extracellular matrix production.[[1]](https://www.hims.com/blog/peptides-for-hair-growth)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_6OWFKA2H0&t=21)\n- **Not DHT blockers:** They do not block dihydrotestosterone (DHT), which is the primary hormone driver of androgenetic alopecia (male- and female-pattern baldness).[[1]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_6OWFKA2H0&t=21)\n\n### What the Research Shows\n\n- **Supportive benefits:** Small studies and lab data indicate they can enlarge hair follicle size and reduce shedding when used consistently for 2 to 4 months.[[1]](https://www.mdhair.co/article/the-truth-behind-copper-peptides-for-hair-care)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_6OWFKA2H0&t=21)\n- **Synergistic use:** They are most effective when paired with established, clinically proven treatments like topical or oral minoxidil or finasteride, rather than used alone.[[1]](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/62U6lCUmcU0)[[2]](https://www.mdhair.co/article/the-truth-behind-copper-peptides-for-hair-care)[[3]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S_6OWFKA2H0&t=21)\n- **Formulations:** They are typically applied daily as topical serums, foams, or shampoos, or used in clinical microneedling protocols.[[1]](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11992372/)[[2]](https://www.rejuvenceclinic.co.uk/copper-peptides-and-their-effects-on-hair-loss/)\n- **Limitations:** They do not regrow hair in areas where follicles have completely died or gone totally dormant, and they lack the large-scale human clinical trials backing pharmaceutical options.[[1]](